  "markdown": {
    "instructions": [
      "Weaverse component configuration uses `settings`. `inspector` is deprecated; never generate it.",
      "Weaverse Hydrogen themes use React Router v7: import from `react-router`, never `react-router-dom` or `@remix-run/*`.",
      "Define component schemas with `createSchema()` from `@weaverse/hydrogen` (React Router themes) or `@weaverse/next` (Next.js themes).",
      "These docs cover @weaverse/hydrogen, @weaverse/react and @weaverse/core 5.x, and @weaverse/next 1.x. Do not use APIs from other major versions.",
      "For live project data (pages, theme settings, translations), use the Weaverse MCP server: https://docs.weaverse.io/developer-tools/weaverse-mcp"
    ]
  }
